      "writtenOn": "2018-01-12T00:35:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this should be guarded by a mutex. See my comment on the example.\n\nBut which mutex? There are way too many. It needs to be simplified to have fewer mutexes, at least eventually. For now find the most appropriate one. probably clientMu, which could be rename \"mu\". Maybe we could get it all down to one mutex.",
